    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Epithelial neuroendocrine neoplasms of the upper aerodigestive tract and salivary glands</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Ozgur Mete",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 697.9pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"931\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Neuroendocrine neoplasm&nbsp;(NEN)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tumour category</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnostic criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Well-differentiated NEN&nbsp;(NET)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Well-differentiated NET, grade&nbsp;1 (G1&nbsp;NET)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No necrosis and &lt;&nbsp;2&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ki-67 &lt;&nbsp;20%<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Well-differentiated NET, grade&nbsp;2 (G2&nbsp;NET)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Necrosis and/or 2&ndash;10&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ki-67 &lt;&nbsp;20%<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Well-differentiated NET, grade&nbsp;3 (G3&nbsp;NE<span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">T)<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&gt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ki-67 &gt;&nbsp;20%<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Absence of NEC cytomorphology</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Poorly differentiated NEN&nbsp;(NEC)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Small cell NEC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&gt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ki-67 &gt;&nbsp;20% (often &gt;&nbsp;70%)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Small cell NEC <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">cytomorphology<sup>b</sup></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"321\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Large cell NEC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 258.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&gt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ki-67 &gt;&nbsp;20% (often &gt;&nbsp;50%)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Large cell NEC <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">cytomorphology<sup>c</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">NEC, neuroendocrine carcinoma; NET, neuroendocrine tumour.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">a</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">Provisional</span> criteria applied at this time. <sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">b</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">Small</span> cell NEC cytomorphology: minimal cytoplasm, hyperchromatic moulded nuclei, finely granular chromatin, inconspicuous nucleoli, cell size smaller than the diameter of three lymphocytes, prominent apoptotic bodies, and necrosis. <sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">c</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">Large</span> cell NEC cytomorphology: nested, organoid, or trabecular growth with abundant cytoplasm, round nuclei with prominent nucleoli, peripheral palisading, rosette formation, and comedonecrosis.</p>",
